PART 2: PROPRIETARY GAME ASSETS, ARTWORK, CHARACTERS, LORE & TRADEMARKS
(ALL RIGHTS RESERVED — COPYRIGHT © 2026 KHALID ABDULLAH)
================================================================================

All non-code creative assets, branding, narrative content, and artistic materials are the exclusive PROPRIETARY property of Khalid Abdullah. This includes, but is not limited to:

1. TRADEMARKS & BRAND IDENTITY:
   - The game title "DEVIL'S DOOR", the studio imprint "Aurex", official logos, slogans ("Reach the door. Trust nothing."), typography treatments, and UI badges.

2. ARTWORK & SCENERY ASSETS:
   - All 4K background artwork, environment illustrations, scenery textures, and matte paintings located in `/src/assets/backgrounds/`, `/website/assets/backgrounds/`, `/Archive/`, and associated directories.

3. CHARACTER ROSTER & VISUAL DESIGNS:
   - All character designs, sprites, silhouettes, names, backstories, and signatures for:
     * #01 Shadow Ninja (Protagonist)
     * #02 Shadow Ronin (Elite Swordsman)
     * #03 Oni Warrior / Oni Guard (Heavy Brute)
     * #04 Cursed Monk (Spectral Sorcerer)
     * #05 Crimson Assassin (Shadow Stalker)
     * #06 Shadow Entity (Void Boss Encounter)
   - The contents of `character.zip` and all derivative character artwork.

4. AUDIO & SOUND EFFECTS:
   - All procedural synthesizer audio patches, sound effects, blade clashes, ambient drones, and acoustic designs.

5. NARRATIVE, STAGE DESIGN & LORE:
   - All worldbuilding, dialogue, realm descriptions, lore bibles, and game design documentation.

